Should we prevent adding auto requests when `metadata_request_policy!="auto"` ?
```suggestion
    def actualize_auto_requests(self):
        if _auto_routing_enabled():
            for param in self._auto_requests:
                self.add_request(param=param, alias=True)
        return self
